{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぃいテスト終わったよー\nうわーいうわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家に帰って昼ごはん食べずに\nすぐ部屋掃除した！\nそんなに散らかってないけど\n掃除したくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"掃除終わったら16時という\n中途半端な時間..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ掃除終わってすぐ食べたけど←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっきりしてからのご飯は\n美味しいですなあ。\nブリ照り、鮭美味いなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子！\n質問答えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春服ってうきうきするよね♪うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありゃ。私服らしくないっていう\n意見多かったなあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ちょっと系統変わったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、そんなことないぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな衣装が好きなの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂らしい膝丈が\n上品ですきかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は黄緑のお洋服はあんまり\n持ってないな～！\n初心者にも挑戦しやすい、\n黄緑のお洋服ってなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黄緑も明るさによって\n着こなしが難しいよね。\n黄緑がアクセントになってるものとか\nなら挑戦しやすいと思う^^*\nでも、一回目立つ明るい色の服\n着てみたら周りを気にせず\n案外着れちゃう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廊下に貼ってある書道の\n「ガウッチ」とかはまりかが\n書いたのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvね！や～よく見てるねっ\nあれはうちのクラスの書道の授業で\nみんな書いたんだよお。\nふはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フルも廊下の壁に注目してね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、まずまりっかをちゃんと\n見てからね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVはどのタイプに\n入ってるのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Aです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのようにしたら認知もらえる\nものなのだ？結構会いに行ってるけど\n覚えてない感じがして...(-｡-;"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい！\n...認知するのに自信がないです。\n顔は覚えてても、どうしても名前が\n覚えられなかったりはします><\n名札とか付けてくださると\nすぐわかる！うん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾄﾞｸﾀｰﾏｰﾁﾝ好きなんですか?(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく履きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんの教科が苦手なのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数学♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまりっかの所行った事\n無いけど行っていいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ来てほしいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートカットにしていた\n時期はあるんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよー小5のとき！\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！春のメロディー！！\n3月だよ！みんな！\nガンガン聴こう！←ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月は卒業シーズン。\nセンチメンタルなのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業生のみなさん、\nおめでとうございます^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあ...私は次高3か。\nはっやー！\n高2の学校生活ってあっという間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、受験生のみなさん、\n報告ありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合格おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は新高校生のとき、\n高校デビューに憧れて\nクールキャラ狙ってみたけど\n無理でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一瞬で設定してたキャラが\n消えました。\nすぐにゲラだってばれました。\n今はもう友達にただのアホって\n言われてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょ、恥ずかしい話させないでよっ///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れーか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れーか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/02/1998073/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まり"}],"source":"archive"}